# The docker/ image build (context: the repo root) copies only these; the rest
# of the tree is bind-mounted at run time, not baked in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!docker/entrypoint.sh

# The statutes worker image copies these out of this repo as a *named*
# build context. BuildKit applies no ignore file to a named context;
# podman/buildah applies the context's own, so without these two the
# COPY finds nothing and the build fails there. This repo's own image
# COPYs explicitly, so a wider allowlist costs it nothing.
!README.md
!jkent
